OL,3,GNEWSABollards to be put up in front of
OL,4,Aram-raided shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Wolverhampton Council said the
OL,7,Frelocation of the existing bollards and
OL,8,Fbenches were short-term measures that
OL,9,Fwould "help protect businesses" and
OL,10,F"reassure the local community".
